1632
01:06:42.520 --> 01:06:45.160
Angela, I'll have you know, I looked it up.

1633
01:06:45.320 --> 01:06:45.580
Yeah.

1634
01:06:46.040 --> 01:06:49.060
The tapeworm diet is a real thing.

1635
01:06:49.340 --> 01:06:50.680
Oh God, really?

1636
01:06:51.040 --> 01:06:55.940
Well, it's obviously illegal in the United States and it's totally dangerous.

1637
01:06:56.240 --> 01:06:57.380
