1638
01:06:57.540 --> 01:07:02.900
I don't know, but I guess you can buy pills that have a tapeworm egg inside of it.

1639
01:07:02.940 --> 01:07:04.000
Don't do this.

1640
01:07:04.200 --> 01:07:11.080
No, I read on Healthline that it doesn't even work because yes, it feeds off your body's

1641
01:07:11.080 --> 01:07:14.040
nutrients, but it feeds off the good stuff too, right?

1642
01:07:14.120 --> 01:07:15.820
It doesn't just eat your fat, everybody.

1643
01:07:15.820 --> 01:07:18.680
It eats everything and you get really sick.

1644
01:07:18.720 --> 01:07:23.400
You can get diarrhea, abdominal pain, nausea, fever, weakness.

1645
01:07:23.680 --> 01:07:25.920
You can also get bacterial infections.

1646
01:07:25.920 --> 01:07:28.200
You can get neurological issues.

1647
01:07:28.740 --> 01:07:31.160
Most of these pills are a scam.

1648
01:07:31.560 --> 01:07:32.080
Okay.

1649
01:07:32.160 --> 01:07:33.660
They do not really have a tapeworm.

1650
01:07:33.660 --> 01:07:40.920
But a woman in Iowa swallowed a real one and she got super sick and she had to confess to

1651
01:07:40.920 --> 01:07:42.240
